# CHANGELOG.md has no merge driver on purpose. The union driver it had
# (2026-06-12 to 2026-10-03) never reached GitHub's mergeability check,
# so PRs merged clean locally and showed CONFLICTING on GitHub (#1267,
# #1279), and union silently mangled the file locally. PRs now add
# changelog.d/ fragments; scripts/changelog.py --base fails a PR that
# edits CHANGELOG.md (internal_docs/changelog_workflow.md).

# Batch files are cmd.exe-only and must check out with CRLF regardless of
# the cloning machine's core.autocrlf: cmd can mis-parse `goto` labels in
# an LF-only .bat, and scripts/make-venv.bat relies on label jumps for its
# name validation.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# ADR 0100 P3 golden deck: byte-exact ordering oracle; no EOL translation.
tests/opensees/parity/*.golden.tcl -text
